  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The new portable mirror is working great, but I wish there were something that allows the mirror to reshape from the 4x4 square it is at the moment. My old portable mirror was shaped like a rectangle and placed vertically, allowing me to see my entire body while in use. It would be great if a button allowed the mirror to go from the 4x4 square to a rectangular shape, allowing users to move it vertically (allowing them to see their entire body while standing) or horizontally (seeing their whole body while laying down). I will also say that the mirror produces a significant amount of lag, so any way to optimize it would be great. Thank you for the hard work.",
